{"_id": "20522446|None", "id": "20522446", "infons": {}, "passages": [{"infons": {"journal": "Jpn J Clin Oncol. 2010 Nov;40(11):1105-9. doi: 10.1093/jjco/hyq087. Epub 2010 Jun ", "year": "2010", "type": "title", "authors": "Masago K, Fujita S, Irisa K, Kim YH, Ichikawa M, Mio T, Mishima M"}, "offset": 0, "text": "Good clinical response to gefitinib in a non-small cell lung cancer patient harboring a rare somatic epidermal growth factor gene point mutation; codon 768 AGC > ATC in exon 20 (S768I).", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "6", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D000077156", "type": "Chemical", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D000077156"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D000077156", "biotype": "chemical", "name": "Gefitinib", "accession": "@CHEMICAL_Gefitinib"}, "text": "gefitinib", "locations": [{"offset": 26, "length": 9}]}, {"id": "7", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D002289", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D002289"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D002289", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Carcinoma Non-Small-Cell Lung", "accession": "@DISEASE_Carcinoma_Non_Small_Cell_Lung"}, "text": "non-small cell lung cancer", "locations": [{"offset": 41, "length": 26}]}, {"id": "8", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalized": [9606], "database": "ncbi_taxonomy", "normalized_id": 9606, "biotype": "species", "name": "9606", "accession": null}, "text": "patient", "locations": [{"offset": 68, "length": 7}]}, {"id": "9", "infons": {"identifier": "1950", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "1483", "valid": true, "normalized": [1950], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 1950, "biotype": "gene", "name": "EGF", "accession": "@GENE_EGF"}, "text": "epidermal growth factor", "locations": [{"offset": 101, "length": 23}]}, {"id": "10", "infons": {"identifier": "tmVar:p|SUB|S|20|I;HGVS:p.S20I;VariantGroup:2;CorrespondingGene:1950;CorrespondingSpecies:9606", "type": "Variant", "valid": true, "subtype": "ProteinMutation", "database": "litvar", "hgvs": "p.S20I", "gene_ids": [1950], "gene_id": 1950, "species_ids": [9606], "species_id": 9606, "rsids": [], "normalized": ["#1950#p.S20I", "#1950#"], "normalized_id": "#1950#p.S20I", "biotype": "variant", "name": "p.S20I", "accession": "@VARIANT_p.S20I_EGF_human"}, "text": "AGC > ATC in exon 20", "locations": [{"offset": 156, "length": 20}]}, {"id": "11", "infons": {"identifier": "tmVar:p|SUB|S|768|I;HGVS:p.S768I;VariantGroup:1;CorrespondingGene:1956;RS#:121913465;CorrespondingSpecies:9606;CA#:135840", "type": "Variant", "valid": true, "subtype": "ProteinMutation", "database": "litvar", "hgvs": "p.S768I", "gene_ids": [1956], "gene_id": 1956, "rsids": ["rs121913465"], "species_ids": [9606], "species_id": 9606, "clingen_id": "CA135840", "rsid": "rs121913465", "normalized": ["rs121913465##", "#1956#", "CA135840#rs121913465##"], "normalized_id": "rs121913465##", "biotype": "variant", "name": "p.S768I", "accession": "@VARIANT_p.S768I_EGFR_human"}, "text": "S768I", "locations": [{"offset": 178, "length": 5}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"type": "abstract"}, "offset": 186, "text": "Recently, two small-molecule kinase inhibitors targeting epidermal growth factor receptor have proven effective in the treatment of non-small cell lung cancer. There are specific activating mutations within the tyrosine kinase domain of epidermal growth factor receptor related to the sensitivity of tyrosine kinase inhibitors. However, it is unknown whether rare mutations in the N-lobe (exons 18-20) and the C-lobe (exon 21) of the epidermal growth factor receptor kinase domain other than L858R in exon 21 and the in-frame deletion in exon 19 may predict the effectiveness of epidermal growth factor receptor-tyrosine kinase inhibitors. We reported a case of non-small cell lung cancer harboring a rare epidermal growth factor somatic mutation, codon 768 AGC > ATC in exon 20 (S768I), who showed a good clinical response to gefitinib. Therefore, we may suggest that this rare mutation (S768I in exon 20) may not be an insensitive epidermal growth factor receptor somatic mutation in vivo.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "25", "infons": {"identifier": "1956", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "74545", "valid": true, "normalized": [1956], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 1956, "biotype": "gene", "name": "EGFR", "accession": "@GENE_EGFR"}, "text": "epidermal growth factor receptor", "locations": [{"offset": 243, "length": 32}]}, {"id": "26", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D002289", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D002289"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D002289", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Carcinoma Non-Small-Cell Lung", "accession": "@DISEASE_Carcinoma_Non_Small_Cell_Lung"}, "text": "non-small cell lung cancer", "locations": [{"offset": 318, "length": 26}]}, {"id": "27", "infons": {"identifier": "1956", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "74545", "valid": true, "normalized": [1956], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 1956, "biotype": "gene", "name": "EGFR", "accession": "@GENE_EGFR"}, "text": "epidermal growth factor receptor", "locations": [{"offset": 423, "length": 32}]}, {"id": "28", "infons": {"identifier": "1956", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "74545", "valid": true, "normalized": [1956], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 1956, "biotype": "gene", "name": "EGFR", "accession": "@GENE_EGFR"}, "text": "epidermal growth factor receptor", "locations": [{"offset": 620, "length": 32}]}, {"id": "29", "infons": {"identifier": "tmVar:p|SUB|L|858|R;HGVS:p.L858R;VariantGroup:0;CorrespondingGene:1956;RS#:121434568;CorrespondingSpecies:9606;CA#:126713", "type": "Variant", "valid": true, "subtype": "ProteinMutation", "database": "litvar", "hgvs": "p.L858R", "gene_ids": [1956], "gene_id": 1956, "rsids": ["rs121434568"], "species_ids": [9606], "species_id": 9606, "clingen_id": "CA126713", "rsid": "rs121434568", "normalized": ["rs121434568##", "#1956#", "CA1267